      "rationale": "TC-11: fails when the agent pool cannot supply a role the obligations catalog can require or a mission-team template declares required, and when a hard separation-of-duties pair can never be independent. Team roles and agent profiles declared capabilities that were never compared, so an uncoverable role was still filled by the least-bad candidate."
