      "rationale": "TC-17: fails when a declared backend utility_fit claim is contradicted by a recorded role-fitness probe, or when the governed reasoning-backend policy allows a mode no capability profile describes. Every CLI and API backend claims judge/divergent capability by default argument and nothing checked it."
