      "owner": "quality",
      "rationale": "S3: registration-ceremony ratchets in tests/ (sharedTmp allowlist, findMissionPath DIRECT_CALLERS, node:fs / child_process / managed-process allowlists, package boundary) previously failed only in CI's test job. Budget: about 30s wall alone, but each file scans libs/ and scripts/, so under the 6-gate concurrent pr run the per-test timeout is raised to 60s and the gate to 300s; tests/core-runtime-import-contract.test.ts (about 30s, needs dist) stays in the test job."
    },
